@secondStageId = {{createStage2.response.body.$.id}}

### Get Stage By Id
# Expect: 200
# @name getStageById
GET {{host}}/api/v1/programs/{{programId}}/stages/{{stageId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{scopedAccessToken}}

