### ==================== 15 · Display ====================

### Setup — Mint Display Token
# Expect: 200
# @name mintDisplayToken
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/display-token
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken2}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "programId": "{{programId}}",
  "expiresInMinutes": 60
}

###
@displayToken = {{mintDisplayToken.response.body.$.displayToken}}

### Display Match State
